  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/2oaAZTrXZKqnZTG-ScU2SBxa-MeuL7zO9oEpGvxgIeU.original.fullsize.png\"/>\nWe have : $x^2+(8 x)=9$\n$\\Rightarrow x^2+9 x-x-9=0$\n$\\Rightarrow x(x+9)-1(x+9)=0$\n$\\Rightarrow(x+9)(x-1)=0 \\quad \\Rightarrow x=-9,1$\nfor $x=1, y= \\pm 2 \\sqrt{2 x}= \\pm 2 \\sqrt{2}$\n$\\sqrt{(2 \\sqrt{2}+2 \\sqrt{2})^2+(1-1)^2}=4 \\sqrt{2}$\n$\\mathrm{L}_n=$ Length of latus rectum $=4 a=4 \\times 2=8$\n$\\mathrm{L}_1 \\lt \\mathrm{L}_2$",
